   "section": "A.1",
   "title": "Ed25519 Private Key",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "text": "{\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"crv\":\"Ed25519\",\n\"d\":\"nWGxne_9WmC6hEr0kuwsxERJxWl7MmkZcDusAxyuf2A\",\n\"x\":\"11qYAYKxCrfVS_7TyWQHOg7hcvPapiMlrwIaaPcHURo\"}",
     "joined": "{\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"crv\":\"Ed25519\",\"d\":\"nWGxne_9WmC6hEr0kuwsxERJxWl7MmkZcDusAxyuf2A\",\"x\":\"11qYAYKxCrfVS_7TyWQHOg7hcvPapiMlrwIaaPcHURo\"}",
     "json": {
      "kty": "OKP",
      "crv": "Ed25519",
      "d": "nWGxne_9WmC6hEr0kuwsxERJxWl7MmkZcDusAxyuf2A",
      "x": "11qYAYKxCrfVS_7TyWQHOg7hcvPapiMlrwIaaPcHURo"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "The hexadecimal dump of private key is:",
     "joined": "Thehexadecimaldumpofprivatekeyis:"
    },
    {
     "text": "9d 61 b1 9d ef fd 5a 60 ba 84 4a f4 92 ec 2c c4\n44 49 c5 69 7b 32 69 19 70 3b ac 03 1c ae 7f 60",
     "joined": "9d61b19deffd5a60ba844af492ec2cc44449c5697b326919703bac031cae7f60"
    },
    {
     "text": "And of the public key is:",
     "joined": "Andofthepublickeyis:"
    },
    {
     "text": "d7 5a 98 01 82 b1 0a b7 d5 4b fe d3 c9 64 07 3a\n0e e1 72 f3 da a6 23 25 af 02 1a 68 f7 07 51 1a",
     "joined": "d75a980182b10ab7d54bfed3c964073a0ee172f3daa62325af021a68f707511a"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "section": "A.2",
   "title": "Ed25519 Public Key",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "text": "This is the public part of the previous private key (which just omits\n\"d\"):",
     "joined": "Thisisthepublicpartofthepreviousprivatekey(whichjustomits\"d\"):"
    },
    {
     "text": "{\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"crv\":\"Ed25519\",\n\"x\":\"11qYAYKxCrfVS_7TyWQHOg7hcvPapiMlrwIaaPcHURo\"}",
     "joined": "{\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"crv\":\"Ed25519\",\"x\":\"11qYAYKxCrfVS_7TyWQHOg7hcvPapiMlrwIaaPcHURo\"}",
     "json": {
      "kty": "OKP",
      "crv": "Ed25519",
      "x": "11qYAYKxCrfVS_7TyWQHOg7hcvPapiMlrwIaaPcHURo"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "section": "A.3",
   "title": "JWK Thumbprint Canonicalization",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "text": "The JWK Thumbprint canonicalization of the two examples above (with a\nlinebreak inserted for formatting reasons) is:",
     "joined": "TheJWKThumbprintcanonicalizationofthetwoexamplesabove(withalinebreakinsertedforformattingreasons)is:"
    },
    {
     "text": "{\"crv\":\"Ed25519\",\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"x\":\"11qYAYKxCrfVS_7TyWQHOg7hcvPapiMlrwI\naaPcHURo\"}",
     "joined": "{\"crv\":\"Ed25519\",\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"x\":\"11qYAYKxCrfVS_7TyWQHOg7hcvPapiMlrwIaaPcHURo\"}",
     "json": {
      "crv": "Ed25519",
      "kty": "OKP",
      "x": "11qYAYKxCrfVS_7TyWQHOg7hcvPapiMlrwIaaPcHURo"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "Which has the SHA-256 hash (in hexadecimal) of\n90facafea9b1556698540f70c0117a22ea37bd5cf3ed3c47093c1707282b4b89,\nwhich results in the base64url encoded JWK Thumbprint representation\nof \"kPrK_qmxVWaYVA9wwBF6Iuo3vVzz7TxHCTwXBygrS4k\".",
     "joined": "WhichhastheSHA-256hash(inhexadecimal)of90facafea9b1556698540f70c0117a22ea37bd5cf3ed3c47093c1707282b4b89,whichresultsinthebase64urlencodedJWKThumbprintrepresentationof\"kPrK_qmxVWaYVA9wwBF6Iuo3vVzz7TxHCTwXBygrS4k\"."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "section": "A.4",
   "title": "Ed25519 Signing",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "text": "The JWS protected header is:",
     "joined": "TheJWSprotectedheaderis:"
    },
    {
     "text": "{\"alg\":\"EdDSA\"}",
     "joined": "{\"alg\":\"EdDSA\"}",
     "json": {
      "alg": "EdDSA"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "This has the base64url encoding of:",
     "joined": "Thishasthebase64urlencodingof:"
    },
    {
     "text": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSJ9",
     "joined": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSJ9"
    },
    {
     "text": "The payload is (text):",
     "joined": "Thepayloadis(text):"
    },
    {
     "text": "Example of Ed25519 signing",
     "joined": "ExampleofEd25519signing"
    },
    {
     "text": "This has the base64url encoding of:",
     "joined": "Thishasthebase64urlencodingof:"
    },
    {
     "text": "RXhhbXBsZSBvZiBFZDI1NTE5IHNpZ25pbmc",
     "joined": "RXhhbXBsZSBvZiBFZDI1NTE5IHNpZ25pbmc"
    },
    {
     "text": "The JWS signing input is (a concatenation of base64url encoding of\nthe (protected) header, a dot, and base64url encoding of the payload)\nis:",
     "joined": "TheJWSsigninginputis(aconcatenationofbase64urlencodingofthe(protected)header,adot,andbase64urlencodingofthepayload)is:"
    },
    {
     "text": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSJ9.RXhhbXBsZSBvZiBFZDI1NTE5IHNpZ25pbmc",
     "joined": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSJ9.RXhhbXBsZSBvZiBFZDI1NTE5IHNpZ25pbmc"
    },
    {
     "text": "Applying the Ed25519 signing algorithm using the private key, public\nkey, and the JWS signing input yields the signature (hex):",
     "joined": "ApplyingtheEd25519signingalgorithmusingtheprivatekey,publickey,andtheJWSsigninginputyieldsthesignature(hex):"
    },
    {
     "text": "86 0c 98 d2 29 7f 30 60 a3 3f 42 73 96 72 d6 1b\n53 cf 3a de fe d3 d3 c6 72 f3 20 dc 02 1b 41 1e\n9d 59 b8 62 8d c3 51 e2 48 b8 8b 29 46 8e 0e 41\n85 5b 0f b7 d8 3b b1 5b e9 02 bf cc b8 cd 0a 02",
     "joined": "860c98d2297f3060a33f42739672d61b53cf3adefed3d3c672f320dc021b411e9d59b8628dc351e248b88b29468e0e41855b0fb7d83bb15be902bfccb8cd0a02"
    },
    {
     "text": "Converting this to base64url yields:",
     "joined": "Convertingthistobase64urlyields:"
    },
    {
     "text": "hgyY0il_MGCjP0JzlnLWG1PPOt7-09PGcvMg3AIbQR6dWbhijcNR4ki4iylGjg5BhVsPt\n9g7sVvpAr_MuM0KAg",
     "joined": "hgyY0il_MGCjP0JzlnLWG1PPOt7-09PGcvMg3AIbQR6dWbhijcNR4ki4iylGjg5BhVsPt9g7sVvpAr_MuM0KAg"
    },
    {
     "text": "So the compact serialization of the JWS is (a concatenation of\nsigning input, a dot, and base64url encoding of the signature):",
     "joined": "SothecompactserializationoftheJWSis(aconcatenationofsigninginput,adot,andbase64urlencodingofthesignature):"
    },
    {
     "text": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSJ9.RXhhbXBsZSBvZiBFZDI1NTE5IHNpZ25pbmc.hgyY0il_MGCj\nP0JzlnLWG1PPOt7-09PGcvMg3AIbQR6dWbhijcNR4ki4iylGjg5BhVsPt9g7sVvpAr_Mu\nM0KAg",
     "joined": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSJ9.RXhhbXBsZSBvZiBFZDI1NTE5IHNpZ25pbmc.hgyY0il_MGCjP0JzlnLWG1PPOt7-09PGcvMg3AIbQR6dWbhijcNR4ki4iylGjg5BhVsPt9g7sVvpAr_MuM0KAg"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "section": "A.5",
   "title": "Ed25519 Validation",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "text": "The JWS from the example above is:",
     "joined": "TheJWSfromtheexampleaboveis:"
    },
    {
     "text": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSJ9.RXhhbXBsZSBvZiBFZDI1NTE5IHNpZ25pbmc.hgyY0il_MGCj\nP0JzlnLWG1PPOt7-09PGcvMg3AIbQR6dWbhijcNR4ki4iylGjg5BhVsPt9g7sVvpAr_Mu\nM0KAg",
     "joined": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSJ9.RXhhbXBsZSBvZiBFZDI1NTE5IHNpZ25pbmc.hgyY0il_MGCjP0JzlnLWG1PPOt7-09PGcvMg3AIbQR6dWbhijcNR4ki4iylGjg5BhVsPt9g7sVvpAr_MuM0KAg"
    },
    {
     "text": "This has 2 dots in it, so it might be valid a JWS.  Base64url\ndecoding the protected header yields:",
     "joined": "Thishas2dotsinit,soitmightbevalidaJWS.Base64urldecodingtheprotectedheaderyields:"
    },
    {
     "text": "{\"alg\":\"EdDSA\"}",
     "joined": "{\"alg\":\"EdDSA\"}",
     "json": {
      "alg": "EdDSA"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "So this is an EdDSA signature.  Now the key has: \"kty\":\"OKP\" and\n\"crv\":\"Ed25519\", so the signature is Ed25519 signature.",
     "joined": "SothisisanEdDSAsignature.Nowthekeyhas:\"kty\":\"OKP\"and\"crv\":\"Ed25519\",sothesignatureisEd25519signature."
    },
    {
     "text": "The signing input is the part before the second dot:",
     "joined": "Thesigninginputisthepartbeforetheseconddot:"
    },
    {
     "text": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSJ9.RXhhbXBsZSBvZiBFZDI1NTE5IHNpZ25pbmc",
     "joined": "eyJhbGciOiJFZERTQSJ9.RXhhbXBsZSBvZiBFZDI1NTE5IHNpZ25pbmc"
    },
    {
     "text": "Applying the Ed25519 verification algorithm to the public key, JWS\nsigning input, and the signature yields true.  So the signature is\nvalid.  The message is the base64url decoding of the part between the\ndots:",
     "joined": "ApplyingtheEd25519verificationalgorithmtothepublickey,JWSsigninginput,andthesignatureyieldstrue.Sothesignatureisvalid.Themessageisthebase64urldecodingofthepartbetweenthedots:"
    },
    {
     "text": "Example of Ed25519 Signing",
     "joined": "ExampleofEd25519Signing"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "section": "A.6",
   "title": "ECDH-ES with X25519",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "text": "The public key to encrypt to is:",
     "joined": "Thepublickeytoencrypttois:"
    },
    {
     "text": "{\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"crv\":\"X25519\",\"kid\":\"Bob\",\n\"x\":\"3p7bfXt9wbTTW2HC7OQ1Nz-DQ8hbeGdNrfx-FG-IK08\"}",
     "joined": "{\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"crv\":\"X25519\",\"kid\":\"Bob\",\"x\":\"3p7bfXt9wbTTW2HC7OQ1Nz-DQ8hbeGdNrfx-FG-IK08\"}",
     "json": {
      "kty": "OKP",
      "crv": "X25519",
      "kid": "Bob",
      "x": "3p7bfXt9wbTTW2HC7OQ1Nz-DQ8hbeGdNrfx-FG-IK08"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "The public key from the target key is (hex):",
     "joined": "Thepublickeyfromthetargetkeyis(hex):"
    },
    {
     "text": "de 9e db 7d 7b 7d c1 b4 d3 5b 61 c2 ec e4 35 37\n3f 83 43 c8 5b 78 67 4d ad fc 7e 14 6f 88 2b 4f",
     "joined": "de9edb7d7b7dc1b4d35b61c2ece435373f8343c85b78674dadfc7e146f882b4f"
    },
    {
     "text": "The ephemeral secret happens to be (hex):",
     "joined": "Theephemeralsecrethappenstobe(hex):"
    },
    {
     "text": "77 07 6d 0a 73 18 a5 7d 3c 16 c1 72 51 b2 66 45\ndf 4c 2f 87 eb c0 99 2a b1 77 fb a5 1d b9 2c 2a",
     "joined": "77076d0a7318a57d3c16c17251b26645df4c2f87ebc0992ab177fba51db92c2a"
    },
    {
     "text": "So the ephemeral public key is X25519(ephkey, G) (hex):",
     "joined": "SotheephemeralpublickeyisX25519(ephkey,G)(hex):"
    },
    {
     "text": "85 20 f0 09 89 30 a7 54 74 8b 7d dc b4 3e f7 5a\n0d bf 3a 0d 26 38 1a f4 eb a4 a9 8e aa 9b 4e 6a\nThis is represented as the ephemeral public key value:",
     "joined": "8520f0098930a754748b7ddcb43ef75a0dbf3a0d26381af4eba4a98eaa9b4e6aThisisrepresentedastheephemeralpublickeyvalue:"
    },
    {
     "text": "{\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"crv\":\"X25519\",\n\"x\":\"hSDwCYkwp1R0i33ctD73Wg2_Og0mOBr066SpjqqbTmo\"}",
     "joined": "{\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"crv\":\"X25519\",\"x\":\"hSDwCYkwp1R0i33ctD73Wg2_Og0mOBr066SpjqqbTmo\"}",
     "json": {
      "kty": "OKP",
      "crv": "X25519",
      "x": "hSDwCYkwp1R0i33ctD73Wg2_Og0mOBr066SpjqqbTmo"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "So the protected header could be, for example:",
     "joined": "Sotheprotectedheadercouldbe,forexample:"
    },
    {
     "text": "{\"alg\":\"ECDH-ES+A128KW\",\"epk\":{\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"crv\":\"X25519\",\n\"x\":\"hSDwCYkwp1R0i33ctD73Wg2_Og0mOBr066SpjqqbTmo\"},\n\"enc\":\"A128GCM\",\"kid\":\"Bob\"}",
     "joined": "{\"alg\":\"ECDH-ES+A128KW\",\"epk\":{\"kty\":\"OKP\",\"crv\":\"X25519\",\"x\":\"hSDwCYkwp1R0i33ctD73Wg2_Og0mOBr066SpjqqbTmo\"},\"enc\":\"A128GCM\",\"kid\":\"Bob\"}",
     "json": {
      "alg": "ECDH-ES+A128KW",
      "epk": {
       "kty": "OKP",
       "crv": "X25519",
       "x": "hSDwCYkwp1R0i33ctD73Wg2_Og0mOBr066SpjqqbTmo"
      },
      "enc": "A128GCM",
      "kid": "Bob"
     }
    },
    {
     "text": "And the sender computes the DH Z value as X25519(ephkey, recv_pub)\n(hex):",
     "joined": "AndthesendercomputestheDHZvalueasX25519(ephkey,recv_pub)(hex):"
    },
    {
     "text": "4a 5d 9d 5b a4 ce 2d e1 72 8e 3b f4 80 35 0f 25\ne0 7e 21 c9 47 d1 9e 33 76 f0 9b 3c 1e 16 17 42",
     "joined": "4a5d9d5ba4ce2de1728e3bf480350f25e07e21c947d19e3376f09b3c1e161742"
    },
    {
     "text": "The receiver computes the DH Z value as X25519(seckey, ephkey_pub)\n(hex):",
     "joined": "ThereceivercomputestheDHZvalueasX25519(seckey,ephkey_pub)(hex):"
    },
    {
     "text": "4a 5d 9d 5b a4 ce 2d e1 72 8e 3b f4 80 35 0f 25\ne0 7e 21 c9 47 d1 9e 33 76 f0 9b 3c 1e 16 17 42",
     "joined": "4a5d9d5ba4ce2de1728e3bf480350f25e07e21c947d19e3376f09b3c1e161742"
    },
    {
     "text": "This is the same as the sender's value (both sides run this through\nthe KDF before using it as a direct encryption key or AES128-KW key).",
     "joined": "Thisisthesameasthesender'svalue(bothsidesrunthisthroughtheKDFbeforeusingitasadirectencryptionkeyorAES128-KWkey)."
    }
   ]
  },
  {
