    {
     "text": "9b 08 f7 cc 31 b7 e3 e6 7d 22 d5 ae a1 21 07 4a\n27 3b d2 b8 3d e0 9c 63 fa a7 3d 2c 22 c5 d9 bb\nc8 36 64 72 41 d9 53 d4 0c 5b 12 da 88 12 0d 53\n17 7f 80 e5 32 c4 1f a0",
     "joined": "9b08f7cc31b7e3e67d22d5aea121074a273bd2b83de09c63faa73d2c22c5d9bbc836647241d953d40c5b12da88120d53177f80e532c41fa0"
    },
    {
     "text": "This is packed into the ephemeral public key value (a linebreak\ninserted for formatting purposes):",
     "joined": "Thisispackedintotheephemeralpublickeyvalue(alinebreakinsertedforformattingpurposes):"
