    },
    {
     "text": "And the sender computes the DH Z value as X448(ephkey,recv_pub)\n(hex):",
     "joined": "AndthesendercomputestheDHZvalueasX448(ephkey,recv_pub)(hex):"
    },
    {
     "text": "07 ff f4 18 1a c6 cc 95 ec 1c 16 a9 4a 0f 74 d1\n2d a2 32 ce 40 a7 75 52 28 1d 28 2b b6 0c 0b 56\nfd 24 64 c3 35 54 39 36 52 1c 24 40 30 85 d5 9a\n44 9a 50 37 51 4a 87 9d",
     "joined": "07fff4181ac6cc95ec1c16a94a0f74d12da232ce40a77552281d282bb60c0b56fd2464c335543936521c24403085d59a449a5037514a879d"
    },
    {
     "text": "The receiver computes the DH Z value as X448(seckey, ephkey_pub)\n(hex):",
     "joined": "ThereceivercomputestheDHZvalueasX448(seckey,ephkey_pub)(hex):"
    },
